  "remembers-where-you-left-off-and-drops-a-restore-point-marked-in": `Remembers where you left off and drops a restore point (marked \u{1F4BE} in "Settings \u2192 Jump back"). It's like a "save" in a game \u2014 press it before closing the book if you want to be completely sure your spot won't be lost.`,
  "refresh": "Refresh",
  "rebuilds-the-page-if-the-layout-breaks-for-example-after-resizin": "Rebuilds the page if the layout breaks \u2014 for example, after resizing the window or opening/closing a sidebar panel or tab (the text may look misaligned). Your current position is preserved.",
  "highlights": "Highlights",
  "opens-the-list-of-all-your-highlights-in-this-book-click-a-row-t": "Opens the list of all your highlights in this book. Click a row to jump to that spot. Above the list is the export-to-notes button.",
