  "the-arrows-at-the-bottom-of-the-screen-the-keys-and-space-or-a-f": `The arrows at the bottom of the screen, the \u2190 \u2192 \u2191 \u2193 keys and space, or a finger swipe on mobile. Every page turn saves your position automatically \u2014 you don't need to press "Save" separately.`,
  "highlights-and-notes": "Highlights and notes",
