  "4-optional-press-at-the-top-and-link-a-book-note-your-page-for-t": '4. (optional) Press \u24D8 at the top and link a "book note" \u2014 your page for this book. You can do this later too.',
  "5-tap-a-highlight-to-book-note-the-quote-flies-into-that-page-an": '5. Tap a highlight \u2192 "to book note" \u2014 the quote flies into that page, and the plugin offers to open it. Done: all your quotes in one place.',
