  "the-0-file-could-not-be-read-the-plugin-stopped-overwriting-it-m": "The {0} file could not be read. The plugin stopped overwriting it; make a backup or restore the file first.",
  "could-not-save-your-reading-position-check-vault-access-the-curr": "Could not save your reading position. Check vault access; the current position is still kept in memory.",
